=00_AQG2psYGHKRSCx2A3ff9eTwk8AHuH4GlMDUhD_mvottcGQ&oe=6A8ED8A1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Covert", "keywords": ["covert", "heist", "coop", "hacker", "stealth"], "long_description": "\u2022\u2022\u2022NOTE\u2022\u2022\u2022 Please make sure you have a device that is fully compatible with the companion app - Supports Android 7.0 - iOS 6 & above.\n\nRecruited by a mysterious client, you & a partner take on a series of high-profile heists. Utilize gadgets to infiltrate heavily guarded facilities as the crafty Thief in VR. Breach through security systems as the clever Hacker on a mobile device.  Cooperation & trust will be needed to sneak past guards, hack through laser grids, crack safes, & much more\u2026\n\nTeam up & pull off the heist of the century!\n\nFeatures:\n6+ hours of gameplay\nCooperative: A successful heist cannot be achieved alone!\nAsymmetric gameplay: Experience the heist as The Thief in VR, or as The Hacker on a mobile device\nCompanion app: Free! Only the VR app requires purchase\nOnline: Play with your friends & family from anywhere\nPass-and-play: Introduce your friends & family to the unique & immersive experience of VR, while putting your stealth, communication, & trust to the test!", "short_description": "Covert is a cooperative heist game where you and a friend work together to pull off the heist of a century."}]}, "developer_name": "White Elk LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://whiteelkstudios.com/index.php/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://whiteelkstudios.com/index.php/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Oculus Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://thecovertgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIR